{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2023-01-12 06:30:00', 'title': 'TARGET CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TARGET CORPORATION (NYSE:TGT) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.08 PER COMMON SHARE.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 10, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS FEBRUARY 15, 2023.'}